{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["Thus you shall bless the children of Israel — that is: you shall not bless with a blessing of your own mouths, like a person who says 'May the produce of so-and-so be such-and-such,' but rather you shall pray to Me and I will bless them, as he explains: יברכך ה׳ — and I will hear your voice when you say it, ואברכם — to Israel, as he explains: ושמו את שמי על בני ישראל — when the priests bless Israel in My name and not in their own name, I will bless them, Israel, in accordance with what the priests prayed and say: יברכך ה׳."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:47.422120504Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}